On MoltenVK a pass's GPU time can hold part of the next pass's work: only the span and the sums of neighbouring passes hold. Individual pass times are omitted; raw per-pass JSON values are not valid alone. Read each pass's own time from a trace (tools/README.md, "GPU trace").
